# The asset pipeline reads source files byte for byte, and names what it cooks from their contents
# (docs/adr/0069-the-asset-pipeline.md): no line-ending conversion on checkout, whatever the
# platform's settings, and metadata files with LF endings everywhere.
*.glb binary
*.gltf -text
*.bin binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.meta text eol=lf
# The list of the sample game's source assets, which scripts/fetch-assets.sh reads line by line
# and field by field: a carriage return would end up in its last field.
*.tsv text eol=lf
